OL,3,GNEWSATwo further arrests over death of
OL,4,Aman in suspected shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo further men aged 29 and 44 have
OL,7,Fbeen arrested in connection with the
OL,8,Fdeath of a man who was killed in a
OL,9,Fsuspected shooting in West Lothian.
OL,11,FBilly Watson, 35, was found with
OL,12,Finjuries after police were called to a
OL,13,Fproperty on Harestanes Road in Armadale
OL,14,Fat about 11:50 on Saturday but died a
OL,15,Fthe scene.
OL,17,FHis death is being treated as murder
OL,18,Ffollowing a post-mortem examination.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
